      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Both approaches address critical aspects of immigration, but a long-term stable solution likely requires a balanced strategy. Focusing solely on enforcement can manage immediate security risks but fails to address labor needs or human capital. Simultaneously, creating clear pathways to citizenship can stabilize communities and integrate immigrants into the economy, providing predictable demographic and labor benefits.",
      "source": "target",
